<title>JAPAN: Hitachi Powdered - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hitachi Powdered - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.03		vs	   13.23</p>
<p> Operating	    1.01		vs	    1.04</p>
<p> Current		1.03		vs	  929    million</p>
<p> Net		  516    million    vs	  479    million</p>
<p> EPS		   16.27 yen	  vs	   15.78 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     32 million	  vs	  30 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hitachi Powdered Metals Co Ltd is one of the largest powder metallurgy products manufacturers.</p>
</text>
